# ROVEXO Camera Search — Performance Master Freeze v1.0

**STATUS: OWNER APPROVED | ALIGNED WITH MASTER FREEZE**

SSOT: `lib/search/camera-search-performance-v1.ts` · Master: `lib/search/camera-search-v1-freeze.ts`

## Contract

```
1 CLICK = 1 PHOTO = 1 SEARCH = 1 STATE UPDATE = 1 AUTO NAVIGATION = 1 RESULTS PAGE
```

Confirm → parallel Promise.all → `setImageSearchResults` → `router.replace("/search/image/results")`

## Forbidden

- Sequential awaits
- `router.refresh` / `location.reload` / `window.reload`
- `setTimeout(5000)` artificial wait
- Second search on results page
- Empty / No Results / Try Again

## Targets

| Tier | Max |
|------|-----|
| 95% | &lt;2s |
| 98% | &lt;3s |
| 100% | &lt;5s |

Loading steps: 4 × 300ms (Validating → Matching → Similar → Preparing)
